        "description": "Known and unknown emails receive the same message; the token is delivered only by SMTP. Five requests per email per 15 minutes. Delivery is deferred until after the response. Missing SMTP configuration returns 503 uniformly.",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
